msgctxt "92"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san! Come by to take a load off?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "What's this line for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Huh? Doesn't everyone love ice cream?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Kaede-san! Stop standing around and start taking orders!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "I'm taking them! Jeez, what's the big rush?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Ma'am! Please let me take over for Kaede-san! We've got\r\n"
"too many customers waiting!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Kaede-san! Why are you making our customers wait!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"I just thought, well, they made the effort to come all\r\n"
"the way here, the least they deserve is a bit of friendly\r\n"
"conversation..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"This is a business, not a social club! Kaede-san... I don't\r\n"
"think you're a good fit for this shop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"I'll give you the rest of your pay, so don't bother showing\r\n"
"up tomorrow, or the next day, either, because you're fired!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "What!? Not again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Ugh... Can't believe I lost another job..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Sounds like you need to pull yourself together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "I was never this busy when I worked part-time in Okinawa..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"I've gotta start the job search again... If I don't work,\r\n"
"I won't even be able to feed myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"See you later, then! I'm gonna see if I can find a job\r\n"
"around here. I'll text you if something works out."
msgstr ""

